{"key": "data.voice.miami.kicked.2", "text": "Dale。是你的损失。", "src": "Dale. Your loss."},
{"key": "data.voice.miami.leaving.0", "text": "Oye！我在这儿坐了一整晚了。", "src": "¡Oye! I've been sitting here all night."},
